:: Rowan Breakfast
<<npc Rowan>><<person1>>
You enter the kitchen and gently slide beside Rowan. <<He>> looks to you with a smile and lets you take the pan. You finish cooking the fresh eggs while Rowan begins readying the plates and setting cups filled with clear water.
<br><br>
As breakfast finishes, the three of you sit together at the table and Rowan offers a silent prayer. It does not take long before the plates are cleaned and the table is clear. Rowan and Mint Mocha take a moment of silent peace before beginning the long day ahead.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Rowan Farmhouse]]>><<set $dailyrowanbreakfast to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Dinner
<<npc Rowan>><<person1>>
You enter the dining room and Rowan guides you to a chair at the small table. Mint Mocha sits poking beside you blushing slightly. You sit together silently as Rowan turns off the stove and makes <<his>> way over with a plate of fresh vegetables and meat.
<br><br>
The three of you sit together at the table and Rowan offers a silent prayer. It does not take long before the plates are cleaned and the table is clear. Rowan and Mint Mocha take a moment of silent peace before returning to their rools.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Rowan Farmhouse]]>><<set $dailyrowandinner to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

