<<link [[Next|Rowan Barn]]>><<transform sheep 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Rowan Cow Observe
You spend some time observing the cows. They can't do much in such a cramped pin and you begin to feel bad for the poor things.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Rowan Barn]]>><<transform cow 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

